  "validationNotes": {
    "scope": "Three complete originals, six exact original/reprint images visually checked. All native Anno keywords, mandatory entry draw and optional hand/grave attack cast tested. Generalize replacement discard slots to one type-qualified Water/Dark creature for Zanb. Merka adds ordinary paid, face-aware, own-turn grave spell permissions keyed by each live source incarnation; reuse the existing serializable zone-use counter and spell finish path.",
